  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enabling Activities to review and update the National Implementation Plan for the Stockholm Convention on Persistent Organic Pollutants (POPs)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce POPs releases from hazardous and municipal wastes by strengthening technical and institutional capacities of a group of pr ivate sectors which can sustain and replicate the best available technique and best environmental practice (BAT/BEP) demonstrated in the project within the context of the implementation of the National Implementation Plan (NIP) under the Stockholm Convention.</narrative>
  </description>
